#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses teams within an organization to group users and "
"provide permissions to projects. This guide will cover how to manage both"
" organization owners and team members. You can read more about "
"organizations and teams in our :doc:`/commercial/organizations` "
"documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:11
msgid "Managing organization owners"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:13
msgid ""
"Organization owners have full administrative access to the organization "
"and all its projects. They can manage settings, teams, members, and other"
" owners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:17
msgid "Adding an owner to an organization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:19
msgid ""
"To grant someone full administrative access to your organization, add "
"them as an owner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:23
msgid "You must be an owner of the organization to add another owner."
msgstr ""

