msgid "Granting access to import a project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:85
msgid ""
"Organization owners can import projects on any team. To let another user "
"import projects, make them a member of any team with *admin* permissions,"
" they will be granted access to import a project on that team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:90
msgid ""
"If your organization uses :ref:`single sign-on with a Git provider "
"<sso_git_provider>`, teams aren't used, and only organization owners can "
"import projects."
msgstr ""

